UPDATE businesses SET description = 'PSOL, trading as Prasper Solutions, is an IT and business-solutions company based on the Ground Floor of Southdowns Ridge Office Park, on the corner of John Vorster and Nellmapius Drive, in Centurion''s Southdowns precinct. The company provides business consulting alongside software and application development, application support and maintenance, DevOps, and the design and build of web and mobile applications. Its services extend to cloud solutions, including cloud migration and ongoing cloud management, enterprise architecture, API integrations, software testing, and the modernisation and optimisation of existing business applications. PSOL works with small, medium and large businesses and organisations, including clients outside South Africa, and lists major South African banks and companies among its customers. By its own account, the company has worked with over 100 customers across more than 80 products and 50 resources, accumulating in excess of 49,000 working hours on client projects. From its Centurion office, PSOL positions itself as a technology partner supporting organisations through the full lifecycle of application development, from initial build through to long-term support and modernisation.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'psol-southdowns' AND description = 'PSOL, also known as Prasper Solutions, is an IT company based in Southdowns Ridge Office Park, Centurion, that specialises in client and management solutions with a customer-centric approach.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
