-- setsolar-pretoria-eldorette (owner)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'setsolar Pretoria is a solar-energy installer operating from 387 Van der Hoff Road and Elsa Street in the Hermanstad and Eldorette area of Pretoria. The business forms part of the broader SetSolar brand, which was founded in 2007 and has since grown its operations into the Gauteng market, with the Pretoria and Centurion operation functioning as a franchise of that group. setsolar Pretoria supplies and installs solar-energy and power-backup systems for both residential and commercial customers, offering grid-tied systems that remain connected to the municipal grid as well as grid-independent systems for full off-grid backup power, with installation capacities ranging from roughly 3kW for smaller homes up to 100kW for larger commercial sites. The company serves homeowners seeking backup power during load-shedding as well as businesses wanting renewable energy and electricity-backup solutions. Across its Gauteng operations, the SetSolar brand has completed more than 1,155 solar installations, reflecting an established track record in the regional solar-installation market that includes this Pretoria branch.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'setsolar-pretoria-eldorette' AND description = 'setsolar Pretoria assembles, imports, distributes and installs solar power equipment, including solar panels, charge controllers, inverters, batteries, cabling, connectors and mounting structures, serving the Hermanstad area of Pretoria.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
